# Never let bytecode into the build context: the Dockerfile COPYs
# container/rootfs/ wholesale, and a stray __pycache__ (e.g. from running
# `python3 -m py_compile` on an overlay file) would be baked into the image
# and shadow the source it was compiled from. The Dockerfile's own cleanup
# only sweeps the vllm/ and aiter/ trees, not the venv top-level modules.
__pycache__
*.pyc
